<%#
# BelongsToSearch Form Partial

This partial renders a searchable select for belongs_to relationships.
Uses the same markup as BelongsTo but with all associated options available.

## Local variables:

- `f`:
  A Rails form generator.
- `field`:
  An instance of Field::BelongsToSearch.
%>

<div class="field-unit__label">
  <%= f.label field.permitted_attribute %>
</div>
<div class="field-unit__field">
  <%= f.select(field.permitted_attribute,
               options_for_select(field.associated_resource_options, field.selected_option),
               { include_blank: true },
               { style: 'width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px;' }) %>
</div>
